# Normalise line endings on commit. Without this, editing on Windows rewrites
# whole files as CRLF and git reports every line as changed — 19 files and
# 6,634 phantom line changes, with no content difference at all.
# A trailing CR in CNAME can also break the GitHub Pages custom domain.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm  binary
